(11774, 80, 'Admin', '/api/product/update-product/1950', 'POST', NULL, 'response', 'Product has been created by Admin', '{\"productName\":\"Cloyster Portable Cat House,Cat Bed 2 in 1 Cat Huts with Washable Removable Cushion Pad,Foldable Cat Igloo Cave Small Dog Bed,Warming Kitten Beds,Covered Small Pet Condos Indoor Cat Hideaway\",\"productDescription\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>✿【Warm Kitten Bed-Provide a Comfortable Home】: The deep design of our thick cat tent keeps your pets feel warm at all times and creates a comfortable and safe feeling for them. The cat beds have raised and thickened edges&sbquo; which can provide better support for the neck and back of your cat or puppy.</li>\\n\\t<li>✿【Super Soft-Cats can&#39;t Help but Knead】: The pet bed uses thick PP cotton to fill it&sbquo; which is super soft and comfortable. Help your kitten to relax and have a comfortable and stable sleep environment. As soft as a mother&#39;s hug. Your cat knead in it! So funny and soft!</li>\\n\\t<li>✿【Detachable Design and Well Made】: The pad inside the cat home can be taken out&sbquo; and the two sides use different materials&sbquo; which are suitable for all seasons. The cushion contains high elasticity cotton&sbquo; high-performance resilience that is not easy to collapse&sbquo; and excellent breathability. The side of the mat is soft artificial lamb wool&sbquo; which is very velvety and does not fall off. The other side is using breathable cotton and linen&sbquo; which is smooth and comfortable without fading.</li>\\n\\t<li>✿【Suitable for Cats and dogs】: This cat house is very convenient to carry&sbquo; giving furry friends a more comfortable sleeping cave anytime and anywhere. The hanging ball on the cat tent brings more fun to your pet! This pet bed is a very soft&sbquo; plush&sbquo; and comfortable home for your kittens&sbquo; cats&sbquo;dogs.</li>\\n\\t<li>✿【Washable and Easy to Clean It】: This round dog bed is easy to clean. There is a zipper on the cushion&sbquo; and the cat litter can be hand or machine washed directly without deformation or damage. To make your cat bed more fluffy&sbquo; you can also use a hairdryer after washing.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"upc\":\"90\",\"sku\":\"cloyster\",\"hsn\":\"34\",\"image\":[{\"productId\":1950,\"image\":\"cat-shelter1681995526390.jpeg\",\"containerName\":\"\",\"defaultImage\":1},{\"productId\":1950,\"image\":\"cat-shelter-21681995536089.jpeg\",\"containerName\":\"\",\"defaultImage\":0}],\"metaTagTitle\":\"\",\"categoryId\":[518],\"model\":0,\"location\":\"\",\"price\":199,\"quantity\":49,\"requiredShipping\":\"0\",\"dateAvailable\":\"2023-04-20\",\"status\":1,\"sortOrder\":99,\"productId\":\"1950\",\"condition\":\"\",\"relatedProductId\":\"\",\"productOptions\":[],\"productDiscount\":[],\"productSpecial\":[],\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":9,\"taxType\":2,\"others\":0,\"productSlug\":\"catshelter1\",\"weight\":0,\"height\":0,\"length\":0,\"width\":0,\"tirePrices\":[],\"hasTirePrice\":0,\"metaTagKeyword\":\"\",\"metaTagDescription\":\"\",\"productVideo\":{\"name\":\"file_example_MP4_640_3MG.mp4\",\"path\":\"video/\",\"type\":1}}', '{\"ip\":\"172.31.39.196\",\"browser\":\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/114.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\"}', '2023-07-13 14:02:22', '2023-07-13 14:02:22', NULL, NULL, 'product'),
