(337, 'BK000016', '20292876540', 100, 2, NULL, NULL, 71, 1, '312.00', '2019-05-13', 1, 'The Mystery in Venice  (English, Paperback, Geronimo Stilton)', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>In each Geronimo Stilton book, another funny, cheesy adventure is always right around the corner. Each book is fast-paced, with lively full-color art and a unique format kids 7-10 will love.When my friend Petunia Pretty Paws gave me a crystal figurine of a boat as a gift, I had to accept it. After all, I have the biggest crush on Petunia! But oh, was that crystal boat ugly! So I wasn&#39;t too sad when my cousin Trap accidentally broke it, especially when I discovered a piece of paper inside with a mysterious message from someone in Venice, Italy, asking for help! A gentlemouse never ignores a request for assistance. So I, Geronimo Stilton, would do whatever it took to save the day!</p>\n', NULL, 'The Mystery in Venice  (English, Paperback, Geronimo Stilton)', NULL, NULL, 1, 20, 'U.K', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-05-13 08:58:43', '2022-11-08 08:43:03', NULL, NULL, 'the-mystery-in-venice-english-paperback-geronimo-stilton', '{\"productCost\":\"312.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 43, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
