(402, 'ML000368', '333030301018', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 75, 1, '520.00', '2019-06-07', 1, 'Casual , Partywear Sneakers Shoes For Men\'s And Boys Red Color Sneakers For Men  (Red)', '<ul>\n	<li>Closure: Lace-Up</li>\n	<li>Material : You&#39;ll love this lightweight Lace-up printed Casual Sneakers It features a synthetic upper, style for Easy fit, PVC Sole, soft lining, cushiony memory foam insole for comfort and support, and a non-marking outsole. Manmade materials.</li>\n	<li>Feature : Extremely lightweight material , It is nice affordable shoes for everyday use, or wedding .This unique design and stylish shoes is to maximize your fashion at the fairest price possible.</li>\n	<li>ABOUT KRAASA : At Kraasa Strive to put our customers at the heart of everything we do. Kraasa aims to help you dress in your own unique upgraded style While actually saving money.So keep shopping and flaunt your style. We have 1000+ styles in footwear category to choose from.</li>\n	<li>Care Instructions:Rotate your pair of shoes once every other day, allowing them to de-odorize and retain their shapes.Dust any dry dirt from the surface using a clean cloth.</li>\n	<li>DISCLAIMER : &quot;KRAASA&quot; is a registered trademark. Any unauthorized sellers will certainly bear the legal consequences of Copyright Infringement.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Casual , Partywear Sneakers Shoes For Men\'s And Boys Red Color Sneakers For Men  (Red)', NULL, NULL, 1, 20, 'India', 0, 0, 0, '3.50', 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-07 01:53:14', '2022-11-08 08:43:06', NULL, NULL, 'casual-partywear-sneakers-shoes-for-mens-and-boys-red-color-sneakers-for-men-red', '{\"productCost\":\"520.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 97, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
