(418, 'BC000884', '441117800029', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 71, 1, '220.00', '2019-06-07', 1, 'Baby Fish: Finger Puppet Book', '<p>Where does Baby Fish like to explore? Follow along with this cute baby animal as it experiences its world, from playtime to bedtime. The simple, comforting stories in this go-to baby gift series have made it a multi-million seller. Featuring a permanently attached plush finger puppet, each volume offers parents and children a fun, interactive way to play and read as they build a lifelong love of books together.</p>\n', NULL, 'Baby Fish: Finger Puppet Book', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'chennai', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-07 04:58:57', '2022-11-08 08:43:19', NULL, NULL, 'baby-fish-finger-puppet-book', '{\"productCost\":\"220.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 113, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(419, 'BT000571', '10000203033', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 70, 1, '490.00', '2019-06-07', 1, 'AsianHobbyCrafts Waterproof Remote Controlled Rock Crawler RC Monster Truck, 4 Wheel Drive, 1:18 Scale  (Blue)', '<ul>\n	<li>The 3-in-1 extreme engines set features a rebuildable race car with lots of authentic details, including a large rear engine, side air intakes, wide rims with low profile tires and adjustable wing mirrors and rear spoiler</li>\n	<li>Features a blue, white, yellow and black colour scheme</li>\n	<li>Adjust the wing mirrors, set the rear spoiler for maximum speed, take your position on the start line and prepare for some high-speed action</li>\n	<li>Continue the adventure with this 3-in-1 model rebuild the extreme engines race car for more high-speed adventures behind the wheel of a powerful hot rod or take to the waves for racing action aboard an aerodynamic speedboat</li>\n	<li>This construction toy is suitable for ages 6-12</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'AsianHobbyCrafts Waterproof Remote Controlled Rock Crawler RC Monster Truck, 4 Wheel Drive, 1:18 Scale  (Blue)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-07 05:15:25', '2022-11-08 08:43:19', NULL, NULL, 'asianhobbycrafts-waterproof-remote-controlled-rock-crawler-rc-monster-truck-4-wheel-drive-118-scale-blue', '{\"productCost\":\"490.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 114, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(420, 'BC000665', '122118890023', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 71, 1, '200.00', '2019-06-07', 1, 'I\'d Know You Anywhere, My Love', '<p>Every child is special and unique, but every child also loves to dream of being something different. In&nbsp;<em>I&#39;d Know You Anywhere, My Love</em>, bestselling author and artist Nancy Tillman has created another heartfelt masterpiece celebrating the joys of imagination, and the comfort of always knowing that &quot;you are loved.&quot;</p>\n', NULL, '', '', '', 1, 10, 'chennai', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-07 05:23:00', '2022-11-08 08:43:19', '~Sports, Books and More~,~Books~,~Childrens~,~I\'d Know You Anywhere, My Love~', NULL, 'id-know-you-anywhere-my-love', '{\"productCost\":200,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 0, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 115, 1, '', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
