(470, 'NT000733', '18088802314', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 81, 1, '1200.00', '2019-06-11', 1, 'Sumeet Granite Finish NonStick Die Cast 4mm Thick Peach color Dosa Tawa 30.5 cm diameter  (Aluminium, Non-stick)', '<ul>\n	<li>&quot;Sumeet Cookware brings to you the Perfect Professional Results for the Home Chef. We&rsquo;re proud to be at the forefront of creating innovative ideas and producing sleek, stylish finishes for today&rsquo;s kitchens. Sumeet introduces a brand-new granite finish heavy weight tawa that is specially crafted for Indian cooking. Designed after a year-long research on material and coating, is the most suitable for making Indian breads (roti, paratha, chilla, etc). Made of Aluminum Die-Cast which distributes heat evenly throughout the tawa. It ensures health of the family and hygiene on the tawa body. Featuring charming Peach color &amp; ergonomically designed, Bakelite handle with &lsquo;Stay Cool&rsquo; technology that will not heat up even after prolonged use on the Gas. Its simple design makes it fairly easy to clean and maintain and will last for a long time even with regular use. Sure to serve you well for a long time, this item is an ideal pick against your valuable currency. Dimension - L X W X H (cms): 30.5x 30.5x 0.7 Weight &ndash; 1.040 Kg.&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Sumeet Granite Finish NonStick Die Cast 4mm Thick Peach color Dosa Tawa 30.5 cm diameter  (Aluminium, Non-stick)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-11 06:41:39', '2022-11-08 08:43:21', NULL, NULL, 'sumeet-granite-finish-nonstick-die-cast-4mm-thick-peach-color-dosa-tawa-305-cm-diameter-aluminium-non-stick', '{\"productCost\":\"1200.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 161, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
