(519, 'EL0013380', '10987776644', 100, 78, NULL, NULL, 81, 1, '300.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'EarthenMetal Pendant Wall Lamp', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Magical ball shaped glass mosaic wall lamp comes with white coloured surface with nano silver mosaics in the centre stage. Red and yellow big flower work enhances the beauty further. When lighted with a bulb/LED/CFL inside it glows with all its beauty to leave you spell bounded. Complemented with metal fittings it is easy to fix on any room wall, gate entrance or lobby.</p>\n\n	<p>&nbsp;</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'EarthenMetal Pendant Wall Lamp', '', '', 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, '0.00', 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 04:34:48', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', '~Home & Furniture~,~Home Lighting~,~Wall Lamp~,~EarthenMetal Pendant Wall Lamp~', NULL, 'earthenmetal-pendant-wall-lamp', '{\"productCost\":300,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 20, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 197, 1, '', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(520, 'HL001277', '10988873336', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 81, 1, '880.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'Gojeeva Uplight Wall Lamp', '<ul>\n	<li><br />\n	Bring home this orange sconce wall lamp proffered by Gojeeva to give your home a new look. Crafted from high quality glass and wood, this lamp is long lasting and energy efficient. This wall lamp produces the same amount of light as normal ones and features a look that is similar to traditional incandescent lights, but it also has a lightweight design and is more energy efficient. Furthermore, it is ideal for placement in kitchens and dining rooms. Additionally, this wall lamp comes with one cable connector and two screws.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Gojeeva Uplight Wall Lamp', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'U.S', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 04:42:37', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', NULL, NULL, 'gojeeva-uplight-wall-lamp', '{\"productCost\":\"880.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 198, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(523, 'MI001147', '10966642222', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 67, 1, '6319.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'Kadence KAD-FNTR34-SUN-C Linden Wood Acoustic Guitar  (Multicolor)', '<ul>\n	<li>From The House Of Kadence Comes The Frontier Series Baby Acoustic. These Acoustic And Semi Acoustic Guitars Are Built To Have Great Sound Quality, High Durability And Increased Ease Of Use For Both Beginners As Well As Professionals. The 30 or 34 Inch Stature Makes It Easy To Handle And Carry Around Without Compromising On The Sound Quality. The Spruce Body Allows For A High Fidelity Resonating Hollow Chamber And The Rosewood Fretboard Makes Is Very Durable With Great Sound Carrying Capabilities. If You Are Looking For A Great Quality Acoustic Guitar The Frontier Series From Kadence Is What You Need.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Kadence KAD-FNTR34-SUN-C Linden Wood Acoustic Guitar  (Multicolor)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 05:48:20', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', NULL, NULL, 'kadence-kad-fntr34-sun-c-linden-wood-acoustic-guitar-multicolor', '{\"productCost\":\"6319.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 199, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(524, 'MI001501', '10664442201', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 67, 1, '5690.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'Kadence 4/4 Classical (Modern) Violin  (Maroon Yes)', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>A violin is the heart of an orchestra. Where other musical and percussion instruments play important roles too like adding power and creating crisp edges, it is the sound created by violins, which&nbsp;floats carrying all the notes with it. So if you are already into this beautiful musical instrument then get this SG Musical violin and practice the long and complex harmonies&nbsp;regularly for a better performance.</p>\n\n	<p><strong>Comes with a Rosin</strong></p>\n\n	<p>You can find a rosin in this violin set, which when rubbed against the bow strings, gives a smooth performance.</p>\n\n	<p><strong>Protective Case</strong></p>\n\n	<p>The violin is packed in a protective case that helps you keep it safe from any kind of damage.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Kadence 4/4 Classical (Modern) Violin  (Maroon Yes)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'U.K', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 06:08:02', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', NULL, NULL, 'kadence-44-classical-modern-violin-maroon-yes', '{\"productCost\":\"5690.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 200, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(525, 'MI001171', '10887333326', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 67, 1, '4200.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'SG Musical BSTABLA215 Tabla', '<ul>\n	<li>Product Color Will be Vary due to handmade instrument</li>\n	<li>Made in india,easy for carry, fully tuned, good quality tabla set</li>\n	<li>Good quality handmade metal drum &amp; sheesham dayan, high quality cushions and covers, special handmade puddis (drumheads)</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'SG Musical BSTABLA215 Tabla', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 06:46:15', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', NULL, NULL, 'sg-musical-bstabla215-tabla', '{\"productCost\":\"4200.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 201, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(526, 'MI001230', '12003888333', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 67, 1, '4200.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'Casio SA-77 KM16 Digital Portable Keyboard  (44 Keys)', '<p><br />\nLet music be a skill that your child begins to nurture from a young age when he/she begins practising with this digital portable keyboard from Casio. It is ideal for young musicians, thanks to its ergonomic design with 44 mini-sized keys and a clear LCD display. It also comes with additional features such as 5 Percussion Pads to let your child add various elements to his/her composition.</p>\n', NULL, 'Casio SA-77 KM16 Digital Portable Keyboard  (44 Keys)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 06:53:16', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', NULL, NULL, 'casio-sa-77-km16-digital-portable-keyboard-44-keys', '{\"productCost\":\"4200.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 202, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(527, 'WM002001', '10888233451', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 77, 1, '340.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'Lakme Absolute Perfect Radiance Skin Lightening Day Creme  (50 g)', '<p>Give your skin a flawless and illuminating glow with the Lakme Absolute Perfect Radiance Skin Lightening Day Creme. The micro-crystals and skin lightening vitamins will help reveal your natural fairness, while the SPF 30 will protect your skin from harmful UV rays.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Moisturizes and Nourishes</strong></p>\n\n<p>It gently moisturizes and nourishes your skin to deliver an even tone for an illuminated look.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Sun Protection</strong></p>\n\n<p>It has SPF 30 to keep your skin protected from the harsh rays of the sun.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n', NULL, 'Lakme Absolute Perfect Radiance Skin Lightening Day Creme  (50 g)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-18 07:24:37', '2022-11-08 08:43:23', NULL, NULL, 'lakme-absolute-perfect-radiance-skin-lightening-day-creme-50-g', '{\"productCost\":\"340.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 203, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(528, 'WM001600', '10988834442', 100, 0, NULL, NULL, 77, 0, '25.00', '2019-06-18', 1, 'Nivea Aloe Hydration Body Lotion  (200 ml)', '&lt;p&gt;Smooth skin begins with the NIVEA Aloe Hydration Body Lotion. Ideal for all skin types&sbquo; this lotion is mild enough to be used daily. Though it is primarily designed for use on the body&sbquo; you can use it on the face too.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long&&#35;45;lasting Hydration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\nThis dermatologically tested lotion absorbs easily into the skin. Once applied&sbquo; it keeps your skin moisturised and smooth for up to 48 hours.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Skin That&amp;rsquo;s Touchably Soft and Visibly Smooth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\nEnriched with aloe vera extracts&sbquo; this alcohol&&#35;45;free lotion soothes dry and irritated skin&sbquo; and nourishes it back to health.&lt;/p&gt;\n', NULL, 'Nivea Aloe Hydration Body Lotion  (200 ml)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, '1.50', 1, 0, 1, 80, 80, '2019-06-18 07:29:47', '2023-04-20 12:00:55', '~Womens Fashion~,~Skin Care~,~Beauty & Grooming~,~Nivea Aloe Hydration Body Lotion  (200 ml)~', NULL, 'nivea-aloe-hydration-body-lotion-200-ml', '{\"productCost\":25,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 0, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 204, 1, '', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(529, 'WH0002001', '1444666555', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 67, 1, '237.00', '2019-06-19', 1, 'Dove Intense Repair Shampoo  (180 ml)', '<ul>\n	<li>Dove dandruff care shampoo leaves hair soft, smooth and flake-free</li>\n	<li>Helps to prevent dandruff and eliminate visible flakes with regular use</li>\n	<li>Formulated with zpto, a clinically proven anti-dandruff treatment</li>\n	<li>Acts on the origin of dandruff from the first wash</li>\n	<li>Formulated with micro moisture serum to nourish hair</li>\n	<li>Gentle enough to use every day</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Dove Intense Repair Shampoo  (180 ml)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-19 01:59:02', '2022-11-08 08:43:29', NULL, NULL, 'dove-intense-repair-shampoo-180-ml', '{\"productCost\":\"237.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 205, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(533, 'EH002008', '10988836633', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 63, 1, '990.00', '2019-06-19', 1, 'boAt BassHeads 100 in-Ear Headphones with Mic (Black)', '<ul>\n	<li>The perfect way to add some style and stand out from the crowd with the boAt BassHeads 100 &quot;Hawk&quot; inspired earphones</li>\n	<li>The stylish BassHeads 100 superior coated wired earphones are a definite fashion statement - wear your attitude with amazing jet black and frosty white colors and get ready to turn heads wherever you go</li>\n	<li>Comes with an amazing commixture of style with performance</li>\n	<li>The powerful 10mm dynamic driver with the speaker resistance of 16 ohm enables the earphone to deliver a punchy, rhythmic response to the most demanding tracks</li>\n	<li>Features a HD microphone to make crystal clear calls - making life easier on the go, play/pause music or answer/end calls with one-click, track forward with two-clicks or back with 3 clicks make these earphones extremely user-friendly</li>\n	<li>With 1.2 meters perfect length cable now plug it in anywhere with ease - while the earphones are extremely user-friendly and stylish, extruding premium coating on the wire cable is a manufacturing process that we&#39;ve been performing and refining since our company&#39;s inception</li>\n	<li>Fits you better than your t-shirt - its impeccable fit won&#39;t let you take these wonderfully amazing earphones off, fits you perfectly without hurting your ears and the perfect arc, with different size ear tips helps you in achieving superior comfort even with long listening hours</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'boAt BassHeads 100 in-Ear Headphones with Mic (Black)', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'India', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-19 04:18:42', '2022-11-08 08:43:29', NULL, NULL, 'boat-bassheads-100-in-ear-headphones-with-mic-black', '{\"productCost\":\"990.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 206, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(536, 'MB002012', '10922635551', 100, 79, NULL, NULL, 77, 1, '230.00', '2019-06-19', 1, 'Makhai Beard Oil For Beard Hair Growth and Moustache for Men with 21 Vital ingredients and Essential Oils | Grow Thick and Fuller Beard - 50 ml', '<ul>\n	<li>CRAFTED WITH A BLEND OF ORGANIC AND NATURAL ESSENTIAL OIL: Makhai Beard Growth Premium Oil is crafted with a blend of Organic and Natural Essential Oils. It has high power ingredients such as sesame oil, avocado oil, jojoba oil, tea tree oil and lemon grass oil that help you in growing your beard</li>\n	<li>GROW A THICKER AND FULLER BEARD FASTER: This Premium Oil fixes the problems of Men who are having trouble growing thick beard. It accelerates Hair growth faster than any normal hair oil, giving you a thicker and fuller beard. The natural ingredients revitalize and helps in the growth, nourishment and strengthening of facial hai</li>\n	<li>MOISTURIZES AND CONDITIONS THE FACIAL HAIR: Makhai beard growth oil helps strengthen your facial hair, moisturizes and conditions it making it softer and manageable</li>\n	<li>PREVENTS DANDRUFF, DRYNESS AND ITCHINESS: It is effective because of the high power ingredients like the blend of organic oils and natural essential oils. It helps your skin by preventing dandruff, rashes, dryness and itchiness while also conditioning the skin underneath</li>\n	<li>USE IT REGULARY FOR SMOOTH AND SHINY BEARD: With regular usage your beard becomes soft, manageable and totally frizz free. Take desired quantity of oil on your Palm, massage the oil on the skin underneath the beard, Finish off by applying all over the beard and relax.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, 'Makhai Beard Oil For Beard Hair Growth and Moustache for Men with 21 Vital ingredients and Essential Oils | Grow Thick and Fuller Beard - 50 ml', NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'U.K', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2019-06-19 05:12:18', '2022-11-08 08:43:29', NULL, NULL, 'makhai-beard-oil-for-beard-hair-growth-and-moustache-for-men-with-21-vital-ingredients-and-essential-oils-|-grow-thick-and-fuller-beard--50-ml', '{\"productCost\":\"230.00\",\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 207, 1, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
