(806, 'JRON', '2332', 400, 0, NULL, NULL, 79, 0, '2000.00', '2021-05-19', 1, 'JRONJ Mini Camera Mini Camera 1080P Hidden Camera', '<p>THE WORLD&rsquo;S SMALLEST WIFI CAMERA: It is designed as a micro cube measuring 0.95in by each side, with included magnetic bracket and clip you can mount it on a desk shelf, fridge door and any places with metal surface to monitor your home or office unnoticed. LIVE MONITORING: Set up the Wifi camera to your smart-phones with App &ldquo;Mini Wifi Cam&rdquo;, you can live view what&rsquo;s going on from anywhere. Perfect for baby monitoring and home security. Even if there is no Internet access, you can insert a micro SD card(Not included) to record video. The camera also supports loop recording, you don&rsquo;t need to worry about the SD card full to stop recording. MOTION DETECTION AND ALARMS: When a motion is detected, the hidden camera will take pictures, then instantly push the photo messages to your phone or your email. You are always be the first one that knows what&rsquo;s going on in your house and small business, you will never miss something that matters. HD NIGHT VISION: The mini WiFi cam will switch to night vision with turning on the Infrared Light automatically in low light environments even in total darkness, it records with a NONE GLOWING and allows you to shot clear videos in 1020p at night up to 15ft. It is a must have for you to monitor what you loved when you are not arround at night. Enhanced with infrared lights turning on at night on the smallest wonders IR led lights will be activated when the light come to the dark. A black and white video mode will be converted that you will get a high-contrast clear video in the dark with exception range.</p>\n\n<p>Read More</p>\n', NULL, 'Electronic', 'Camera', 'Camera', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-05-19 11:39:27', '2022-11-08 08:43:32', '~Sport action~,~JRONJ Mini Camera Mini Camera 1080P Hidden Camera~', NULL, 'jronj-mini-camera-mini-camera-1080p-hidden-camera', '{\"productCost\":2000,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '22.00', '22.00', '33.00', '12.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 531, 1, '244', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
