(840, 'SKU56457U', '5645', 50, 4, NULL, NULL, 83, 0, '2000.00', '2021-05-22', 2, 'GOQii Smart Vital Fitness SpO2, body temperature and blood pressure tracker with 3 months personal Coaching', '<ul>\n	<li>GOQii Smart Vital is certified under 3 grades by the International Organization for Standardization (ISO). GOQii Smart Vital is also a registered medical tracker (CDSCO) &amp; is much better and more accurate than any smart watch.</li>\n	<li>Monitoring your body temperature &amp; blood oxygen (SpO2) levels was never so easy as it is powered by intelligent technology.</li>\n	<li>It has 24x7 heart monitoring and Auto Sleep tracking. You can also track all day activity like steps, distance, calories burned, active time &amp; once again makes it better than any smart watch.</li>\n	<li>GOQii smart vital comes with 1.3 inches colour display with full touch screen. It has multiple customize watch faces, find my phone, music control, camera, stopwatch, timer, raise to wake, alarms, inactivity alerts</li>\n	<li>It is IP68 Water/Dust resistant</li>\n	<li>Smart notification allows you to read phone notification such WhatsApp, Facebook, calls, SMS on the device itself</li>\n	<li>Battery charger: 2 pin magnetic charger- remove the strap and put the core on it to charge. Up to 7 days of battery life under normal usage</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-05-22 09:03:06', '2022-11-08 08:43:38', '~Smart Watches~,~GOQii Smart Vital Fitness SpO2, body temperature and blood pressure tracker with 3 months personal Coaching~', NULL, 'goqii-smart-vital-fitness-spo2-body-temperature-and-blood-pressure-tracker-with-3-months-personal-coaching', '{\"productCost\":2000,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 577, 1, '7688', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
