(894, 'SKU3475634', '34454', 55, 4, NULL, NULL, 84, 0, '799.00', '2021-05-22', 3, 'CLYMB Outdoor Sports Running Shoes for Mens Boy', '<ul>\n	<li>Sole: Polyvinyl Chloride</li>\n	<li>Closure: Lace-Up</li>\n	<li>Shoe Width: Medium</li>\n	<li>Feature: Extremely lightweight material, these are nice shoes for everyday use, or wedding .this unique design and stylish shoes are to maximize your fashion.</li>\n	<li>About Clymb : At Clymb strives to put our consumers at the heart of everything we do. Clymb aims to help you dress in your own unique upgraded style. So keep shopping and flaunt your style.</li>\n	<li>Extra Comfort:The shoes feature an PVC sole which is used extensively to create shoe soles. This makes the shoes sturdy and also provides extra comfort to your feet.</li>\n	<li>Style Plus:You can wear this shoes as daily wear or for your workout schedule. The shoes can be matched with jeans or track pants of your choice for a casual day out or a workout schedule in the gym.</li>\n	<li>Care Instructions: Rotate your pair of shoes once every other day, allowing them to de-odorize and retain their shapes. Dust any dry dirt from the surface using a clean cloth.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-05-22 15:21:39', '2022-11-08 08:43:40', '~Running Shoes~,~CLYMB Outdoor Sports Running Shoes for Mens Boy~', NULL, 'clymb-outdoor-sports-running-shoes-for-mens-boy', '{\"productCost\":799,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 654, 1, '45454', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
