(1027, 'sku746638', '34234', 50, 4, NULL, NULL, 84, 0, '369.00', '2021-05-24', 4, 'LivEasy Extra Soft Ortho Care Diabetic  Orthopedic Slippers Doctor Chappal  Footwear  Women', '<ul>\n	<li>Sole: Polyurethane</li>\n	<li>Closure: slip on</li>\n	<li>Shoe Width: Medium</li>\n	<li>These slippers can help to improve blood circulation. The improved blood circulation can help in restoring the lost sensation of feet due to neuropathy.</li>\n	<li>Foam insoles take the shape of your feet. They bring relief from sharp pain or cramps of the feet.</li>\n	<li>Slippers fit perfectly because they come with multiple straps to avoid friction.</li>\n	<li>Comfort and elegance are guaranteed because the slippers are made from rich milled leather.</li>\n	<li>Light-weight PU soles give the feeling of walking barefoot.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-05-24 07:47:03', '2022-11-08 08:43:49', '~Orthopaedic Slippers~,~LivEasy Extra Soft Ortho Care Diabetic  Orthopedic Slippers Doctor Chappal  Footwear  Women~', NULL, 'liveasy-extra-soft-ortho-care-diabetic-orthopedic-slippers-doctor-chappal-footwear-women', '{\"productCost\":369,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 790, 1, '34333', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(1028, 'SKU6452378', '3534', 50, 4, NULL, NULL, 82, 0, '499.00', '2021-05-24', 2, 'DOCTOR EXTRA SOFT Slipper for Women Orthopaedic and Diabetic Comfort Ortho Care,Pregnancy Flip-Flop, Slides and House Slipper for Women', '<ul>\n	<li>Sole: Rubber</li>\n	<li>Closure: hook &amp; loop</li>\n	<li>Shoe Width: Medium</li>\n	<li>DIABETIC AND ORTHOPEDIC: - Extra Soft, Padded, Comfortable and Cushioned Foot-Bed Enhances Comfort to the Feet. Doctor Extra Soft Slipper Provides You Better Walking Comfort and also makes you&rsquo;re Walking Life easy and effortlessly.</li>\n	<li>ANTI-SKID AND ADJUSTABLE VELCRO: - Good Rubber Grip Enables You to Use These Slippers on Wet Floors, Tiles, Marbles, Etc. This Rubber Sole Is Long Lasting and Provides Uninterrupted Daily Usage. Its adjustable velcro is specially designed for people suffering from swelling feet and Diabetic, Orthopaedic people.</li>\n	<li>LIGHTWEIGHT AND DURABLE: - They Are Extremely Light Weight and Durable Slippers and Are Widely Used by Women&rsquo;s / Ladies for All Ages, Especially Old Aged, Men with Foot, Knee and Back Pain, Arthritis, Plantar Fasciitis, Etc.&nbsp;These Extra Soft Doctor Slippers are mostly used by Women&rsquo;s of all ages, Especially old aged suffering from Diabetes, Plantar fasciitis, Ortho Pain, Heel Pain, Arch Pain, Ankle Pain, Knee Pain and Back Pain</li>\n	<li>MEDICATED SOFT DOCTOR SLIPPERS - Recommended&nbsp;by Doctors and Podiatrists for Diabetic, Orthopaedic, Cracked heals and obese&#39;s person&#39;s problem. Its&nbsp;EVA is Skin-friendly, bio-degradable, 100% recyclable and non-allergic material has been used which is skillfully crafted to provide optimum support to your ailing feet.</li>\n	<li>SKIN FRIENDLY AND STYLISH - Its Skin-Friendly material are Crafted and made with care that avoids Blisters, Scars, Sweating of the feet and Pain. These Stylish Slippers Fits Your Lifestyle Where Your Feet Looks Pretty Which Provides Premium Look and Feels to The Feet.&nbsp;Various Colours Are Not Only Colourful &amp; Highly Attractive to Look at But Also Gives You Option to Buy Slippers as Per Your Choice Than Chance.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-05-24 07:50:33', '2022-11-08 08:43:49', '~Orthopaedic Slippers~,~DOCTOR EXTRA SOFT Slipper for Women Orthopaedic and Diabetic Comfort Ortho Care,Pregnancy Flip-Flop, Slides and House Slipper for Women~', NULL, 'doctor-extra-soft-slipper-for-women-orthopaedic-and-diabetic-comfort-ortho-carepregnancy-flip-flop-slides-and-house-slipper-for-women', '{\"productCost\":499,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 791, 1, '3345', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
