(1205, 'SKU734563457458', '5656', 50, 4, NULL, NULL, 87, 0, '1200.00', '2021-06-15', 1, 'AX BOXING Mens Fashion Sneakers Low Top Casual Shoes Leather Breathable Comfortable Walking Shoes', '<ul>\n	<li>100% Leather</li>\n	<li>Rubber sole</li>\n	<li>Fashion Look &mdash;&mdash; These mens fashion sneakers using top quality leather, hollowed air breathable hole design ensure comfortable durable enough to last a long time, leather with tonal stitching design makes this shoe have a casual-cool look.</li>\n	<li>Breathable Mesh Inner &mdash;&mdash; The mens casual shoes using breathable cotton inner and insole is skin-friendly and moisture-wicking, the inner and outer airflow can circulate efficiently make your feet comfortable breathable all the time.</li>\n	<li>Anti-skid Rubber Outsole &mdash;&mdash; The mens shoes outsole is strong durable rubber with bump texture for stable traction, durability and flexibility, safe for you to perform various movements.</li>\n	<li>Low-Top Design &mdash;&mdash; This sneakers footwear with the low-top design, advanced leather and textile fabrics spliced along the top line, increasing comfortable and mobility at the ankles.</li>\n	<li>Lace-up Design &mdash;&mdash; The classic flat lace-up closure design casual shoes for men, make you can easy to put on and take off and to put on and take off. And we provide a size chart on Product description. Please see the Size Reference to find the fit size.</li>\n</ul>\n', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-06-15 07:32:53', '2022-11-08 08:44:03', '~Casual Shoes~,~AX BOXING Mens Fashion Sneakers Low Top Casual Shoes Leather Breathable Comfortable Walking Shoes~', NULL, 'ax-boxing-mens-fashion-sneakers-low-top-casual-shoes-leather-breathable-comfortable-walking-shoes', '{\"productCost\":1200,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1683, 1, '5656', '', 0,