(1303, 'SKU5634789', '4563', 50, 4, NULL, NULL, 84, 0, '1599.00', '2021-06-16', 1, 'Krystle Prime Men Cotton Khakhi Slim fit Cargo Pant (Khaki)', '<ul>\n	<li>PREMIUM CARGO STYLE. Made with premium materials for comfort, this classic cargo pant takes you from the workplace and the outdoors, to everyday casual wear.</li>\n	<li>RELAXED STRAIGHT LEG FIT. These premium cargo pants sit at the natural waist with a relaxed seat and thigh. Finished with a roomy straight leg cut, these cargo pants will keep you comfortable all day.</li>\n	<li>MAXIMUM STORAGE. Equipped with (8) pockets for maximum storage capacity. (4) cargo flap pockets, (2) slash pockets, and (2) back pockets with flaps - great for storing cell phones, wallets, tools, and other items.</li>\n	<li>Elastic with Drawstring closure</li>\n	<li>Please choose a right size while placing an order. The size of the trouser is based on the waist size for example: if one wears trousers of waist size 32 inches then please choose size 34. You can also write to us for assistance using &quot;ASK SELLER A QUESTION&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr />', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-06-16 10:34:28', '2022-11-08 08:44:11', '~Cargos~,~Krystle Prime Men Cotton Khakhi Slim fit Cargo Pant (Khaki)~', NULL, 'krystle-prime-men-cotton-khakhi-slim-fit-cargo-pant-khaki', '{\"productCost\":1599,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1801, 1, '65546', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
