(1469, 'SKU5634785', '4565675', 50, 4, NULL, NULL, 87, 0, '799.00', '2021-06-18', 1, '9happymonths Women 100 Organic Cotton Night Suit Set', '<ul>\n	<li>Care Instructions: Wash with like colors. Do no bleach. Refer size chart before ordering.</li>\n	<li>ATTRACTIVE DESIGN &amp; PRINT: 9HappyMonths Night Suit is designed to feel like your second skin and has an array of uber cool prints to choose from</li>\n	<li>GOTS 100% ORGANIC COTTON: GOTS certified organic cotton, used in 9HappyMonths Night Suit is made from organic fibers, having met strict environmental and social criteria during processing. This makes it uniquely ethical, breathable and comfortable. This Bio-washed fabric retains its newness even after several washes.</li>\n	<li>ULTRA COMFORTABLE: While sleeping and lounging around, you will need a night suit that not only gives your comfort but also soothes your day&#39;s fatigue and worries. 9HappyMonths Night Suit is your ideal companion with easy design and smoothest fabric. Its self-fabric design ensures that it does not cling to your body for an effortless style.</li>\n	<li>DESIGNED WITH LOVE: This Sleepwear inspired nursing night suits has a unique-shaped bottom hem that gives a slim look and fits your body. It boasts engineered flat seam for ease of movement. The bottomwear Pyjama has a combination of Elastic &amp; Drawstring for best fit and pocket for you to keep essential items such as keys, money or mobile.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr />', NULL, '', '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2021-06-18 12:21:06', '2022-11-08 08:44:25', '~Night Suit~,~9happymonths Women 100 Organic Cotton Night Suit Set~', NULL, '9happymonths-women-100-organic-cotton-night-suit-set', '{\"productCost\":799,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1976, 1, '645756', '', 0, 1, 0, NULL),
