(1553, '67457458', '6875755', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 77, 0, '1504776.00', '2021-07-22', 0, 'Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P)', '<ul>\n	<li>Max. speed: 5 km/h</li>\n	<li>Sound pressure level: 63.8 dB(A)</li>\n	<li>Productivity 1 side broom theoretical/actual: 4900/3430 m&sup2;/h</li>\n	<li>Productivity 2 side brooms theoretical/actual: 6300/4410 m&sup2;/h</li>\n	<li>Working width w/right side broom: 980 mm</li>\n	<li>Working width w/2 side brooms: 1260</li>\n	<li>Min. turn-around aisle width: 238</li>\n	<li>Max. climbing rate: 20%</li>\n	<li>Side broom diameter: 420 mm</li>\n	<li>Main broom speed: 550 RPM</li>\n	<li>main Broom: 700x300 mm</li>\n	<li>Battery compartment size: 660 x 440 x 370 mm</li>\n	<li>The vast majority of ride-on professional sweeping jobs demand a machine that is compact, manoeuvrable and reliable.</li>\n	<li>SR1101 represents simplicity and robustness in its most sophisticated form.</li>\n	<li>Recommended for factory warehouses, car parks and outside areas such as parks and gardens, R1101 is easy to operate and self-explanatory operating panel means less operator training time needed.</li>\n	<li>The SR 1101 is available in both battery and petrol versions for indoor or outdoor operation with a large range of optional accessories which provides the right tools for specific jobs. Accessory flexibility permits better and faster cleaning. The 70 litre hopper offers greater debris storage and less emptying time.</li>\n	<li>Battery version offers up to 5 hours of running time</li>\n	<li>Climbing rate up to 20%</li>\n	<li>A large flap and 70 l of hopper to easy collect dirt and large debris</li>\n	<li>3.6 m2 of filter for an optimal dust control</li>\n	<li>Strong polyethylene construction plus steel frame; with robust solutions to avoid sources of malfunctions and minimise service</li>\n	<li>Theoretical productivity of 4410 m2 per hour with the optional left side broom</li>\n	<li>The standard version is delivered with 1 main broom, 1 right side broom and 1 paper filter</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Buy Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) online in India at wholesale rates. If you have been looking for Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) dealers, your search ends here as you can get the best Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) distributors in top cities such as Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Chennai, Bengaluru, Kolkata, Chennai, Pune, Jaipur, Hyderabad and Ahmedabad. You can purchase Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) of the finest quality and rest assured to get the best in terms of both durability and performance. If you are bothered about the Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) prices, you can be totally sure to get the best rates as Industrybuying brings you genuine Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) rates and quality assured products only from the best of brands with exclusive brand discounts you won&rsquo;t find anywhere else. Procure Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) today and avail the best offers on your purchase.</p>\n', NULL, 'Buy Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) Online in India at Best Prices', '<p>Buy Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P) Online in India for only Rs 1504776. Shop from the huge collection of Nilfisk Sweepers. Wholesale Price FREE Shipping* COD</p>\n', 'Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P), Sweepers, low price, Industrybuying', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 155, NULL, '2021-07-22 12:09:01', '2022-11-08 08:44:28', '~Sweepers~,~Nilfisk Sweeper SR 1101 (P)~', NULL, 'nilfisk-sweeper-sr-1101-p', '{\"productCost\":1504776,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 2319, 1, '6875755', NULL, 0, 2, 0, NULL),
