(1583, 'SKU097653', 'UPC33312', 46, 4, NULL, NULL, 77, 0, '3975.00', '2022-03-22', 0, 'Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single)', '<p>Variable Transformers excellent power regulation with negligible variation in output voltage from no-load to full-load current. Supply voltage adjustment, boosting of low lines and line voltage stabilization, either manually or automatically in automatic voltage stabilizers. The primary and secondary circuits therefore have a number of windings turns in common. Since the volts-per-turn is the same in both windings, each develops a voltage in proportion to its number of turns. In an autotransformer part of the current flows directly from the input to the output. Feature:- Power Rating - 6VA, Single Phase.</p>\n\n<p>Buy Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) online in India at wholesale rates. If you have been looking for Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) dealers, your search ends here as you can get the best Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) distributors in top cities such as Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Chennai, Bengaluru, Kolkata, Chennai, Pune, Jaipur, Hyderabad and Ahmedabad. You can purchase Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) of the finest quality and rest assured to get the best in terms of both durability and performance. If you are bothered about the Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) prices, you can be totally sure to get the best rates as Industrybuying brings you genuine Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) rates and quality assured products only from the best of brands with exclusive brand discounts you won&rsquo;t find anywhere else. Procure Crown Electronic Variable Auto Transformer 6A (Phase-Single) today and avail the best offers on your purchase.</p>\n', NULL, 'Transformer', '<p>Variable Transformers excellent power regulation', 'Transformer', NULL, NULL, NULL