ands with exclusive brand discounts you won&rsquo;t find anywhere else. Procure Ferm High Pressure Washer Cleaner 140 Bar Induction Motor GRM1023 today and avail the best offers on your purchase.</p>\n', NULL, 'Buy Ferm High Pressure Washer Cleaner', '<p>Buy Ferm High Pressure Washer Cleaner\n', 'Ferm High Pressure Washer Cleaner', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 155, NULL, '2021-07-26 12:19:18', '2022-11-08 08:44:38', '~Vendor Attribute Product~,~Ferm High Pressure Car Washer Cleaner 140 Bar Induction Motor GRM1023~', NULL, 'ferm-high-pressure-car-washer-cleaner-140-bar-induction-motor-grm1023', '{\"productCost\":19900,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 1, 0, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3007, 1, '93545258', '~Car Washer-1~', 0, 2, 0, NULL),
