(1926, 'Snow', '100', 100, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '799.00', '2023-04-12', 5, 'Bacca Bucci SNOWMAN Original 7-Eye Genuine Leather water proof ankle Snow boots for Men-With FUR', '&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Sole: Rubber&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Closure: Lace&&#35;45;Up&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Shoe Width: Medium&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Upper: Genuine PDM leather&amp;nbsp;upper is durable for long time use. Good water resistant performance keeps you from getting wet when walking in the snow and rain.Not easy to get dirty and also easy to clean with cloth.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;TPR Out&&#35;45;sole:TPR out&&#35;45;sole is durable&&#35;45;no easy to feel apart. Keep your feet get warm easily. Good wear&&#35;45;resistance and cushion support. Flexible deep grooves and tread on the out&&#35;45;sole is anti&&#35;45;slip.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Warm and Soft Inside: Covered with thick fur&sbquo; these snow boots inside are super warm and soft. It is not easy to fall off. Thick leather with aluminum foil layer can keep your feet in the most suitable temperature. Your feet will not feel cold in winter or feel hot or sweating in long time walking.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Classic Design: Suitable length lace can well adjust the snow boots. Sturdy lace hook is no easy to go apart and ensures lace doesn&amp;rsquo;t easily loosen. Fixed snow boots tongue cover the top of boots&&#35;45; no snow can get into your feet. Enough room for interior&&#35;45;no hurting your toes and ankle.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Suitable For: Winter&sbquo; snowy day&sbquo; raining day&sbquo; fishing&sbquo; skiing&sbquo; hiking&sbquo; walking the dog&sbquo; walking&sbquo; mountaineering&sbquo; camping&sbquo; casual&sbquo; working&sbquo; shopping&sbquo; driving&sbquo; vacation&sbquo; also is a good holiday gift.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2023-04-20 06:48:00', '2023-04-20 06:48:00', '~Winter Wear~,~Bacca Bucci SNOWMAN Original 7-Eye Genuine Leather water proof ankle Snow boots for Men-With FUR~', NULL, 'snowshoes-men', '{\"productCost\":799,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 2, 9, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3836, 1, '500', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
(1927, 'Snowwomen', '30', 600, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '699.00', '2023-04-01', 56, 'ALEADER Women\'s Warm Faux Fur Lined Mid Calf Winter Snow Boots', '&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Sole: Rubber&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Closure: Lace&&#35;45;Up&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Shoe Width: 10&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Shaft measures approximately 7.5&amp;quot; from arch. FITTING TIPS: Full Size Only.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Waterproof special fabric upper. Seam sealed waterproof construction.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Mid&&#35;45;height snow boot featuring waterproof shell bootie and durable ripstop shaft with D&&#35;45;ring lacing hardware and fuzzy felt cuff&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Cold&&#35;45;weather boot featuring 200g Thermolite insulation rated to &&#35;45;25F&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;All&&#35;45;weather protection and a toasty layer of insulation.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2023-04-20 06:52:16', '2023-04-20 06:52:16', '~Womens Fashion~,~ALEADER Women\'s Warm Faux Fur Lined Mid Calf Winter Snow Boots~', NULL, 'ladiessnowshoes', '{\"productCost\":699,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 2, 9, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3837, 1, '45', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
