(1943, 'babymittens', '30', 100, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '199.00', '2023-04-01', 2, 'My Newborn Baby Mittens Caps Gloves and Booty Combo Set - Pair of 3 (Assorted Colours, 0-3 Months) | Unisex Booty Set | Durable Cotton Gift Set | Multicoloured Hand Gloves and Socks | Winter Clothing', '&lt;ul&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Cotton Material: Our newborn mitten set is made of soft fabric and pure fine cotton. This will help the baby feel free and comfy. Cotton clothes make sure that your infant doesn&amp;&#35;39;t feel the discomfort of wearing clothes. Other than being soft and skin&&#35;45;friendly&sbquo; cotton is also highly breathable. It is ideal for all seasons. This cotton mitten set is durable and withstands regular usage. Our 100% cotton mitten booty set is anti&&#35;45;allergic hence kids with asthma or allergies can also wear it.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Useful Combo: My NewBorn baby mitten set comes in a pack that includes 3 mittens&sbquo; hand gloves&sbquo; and socks in assorted printed colors. Mitten is a winter clothing essential that covers your newborn&amp;&#35;39;s whole hand&sbquo; unlike gloves that cover each hand separately. You get cotton socks&sbquo; hand gloves&sbquo; and Mitton booty in one set that is going to be your baby&amp;&#35;39;s favorite thing to wear in the cold.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Safe &amp;amp; stylish: This baby mitten set will definitely make your new born feel soft and warm. My NewBorn&amp;&#35;39;s mittens will keep the kid away from blueish cold hands and feet. It&amp;&#35;39;s a great purchase to protect your infant&amp;&#35;39;s health. With the print&sbquo; they are also stylish&sbquo; cute&sbquo; and attractive. the quality cloth and dye&sbquo; will make your baby look beautiful while also being skin friendly.You can always gift this wonderful product to your friends&amp;&#35;39; or relatives&amp;&#35;39; baby showers.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Travel&&#35;45;friendly: Our mitten set is easy to carry in a handbag and ideal for travel purposes. They are safe and necessary for the baby. The soft fabric set will make sure the right temperature is maintained. Our pure cotton will help them sleep better without any disturbance.&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;li&gt;Wash&&#35;45;care: Our mitten set is long&&#35;45;lasting and highly durable. You can always choose this as your infant&amp;&#35;39;s regular wear. Cotton will never cause any trouble to your new born&amp;&#35;39;s softy skin. This will instead make them feel warm and comfy. You can never go wrong with this gentle fabric. Just make sure to hand wash with mild detergent.&lt;/li&gt;\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 80, NULL, '2023-04-20 09:22:48', '2023-04-20 09:22:48', '~Baby & Kids~,~My Newborn Baby Mittens Caps Gloves and Booty Combo Set - Pair of 3 (Assorted Colours, 0-3 Months) | Unisex Booty Set | Durable Cotton Gift Set | Multicoloured Hand Gloves and Socks | Winter Clothing~', NULL, 'babymittens', '{\"productCost\":199,\"packingCost\":0,\"shippingCost\":0,\"tax\":0,\"others\":0}', 2, 9, NULL, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3853, 1, '23', NULL, 0, 1, 0, NULL),
